Identifier regex: [-\w] plus escapes... keep simple: /^[-\w\\]|^\\./ hmm just use /[-\w]+/ and allow escapes minimally. Good enough.

For functional args of :not/:is/:has: split top-level commas, recursively compute specificity of each via full pipeline (split combinators + compounds), take max, add.

Legacy pseudo-element single colon names: before, after, first-line, first-letter.

Also case-insensitivity: lowercase names.

cascadeSort(rules): sort by (a,b,c) ascending then sourceOrder ascending — "later winning" means stable sort with later order coming last. Compare specificity triples lexicographically; ties broken by sourceOrder. Return sorted array (new array).

